# Notice

This repository is a derivative of **github-profile-kit** by Jon Andoni Baranda
(https://github.com/jandoni/github-profile-kit), released under the MIT License.

The generator scripts (`header.py`, `buttons.py`, `terminal.py`, `cards.py`,
`build.py`, `preview.py`, `kit.py`, `fetch_icons.py`), the README template and
the daily workflow follow that kit's structure. Changes made here:

- The palette is Kerman's own gruvbox theme (`@k3rman/ui-theme`), not the
  original warm-paper one.
- The header is rebuilt: a mono eyebrow, a paper grid, IBM Plex embedded via
  `@font-face`, and the portrait cut into a circle instead of a rectangular
  fade.
- IBM Plex Sans / IBM Plex Mono are embedded in every SVG. The font files in
  `fonts/` are redistributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (`fonts/LICENSE.txt`).
- The terminal renders on gruvbox charcoal and uses the dark snake palette.
- Card panels set the project name in mono instead of serif italic.

Tool icons come from Simple Icons (CC0-1.0). The GitHub and LinkedIn marks are
used nominatively to link to their own sites.
